    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n22758" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γραμμᾰτ-ιστής</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">οῦ</span>, ὁ, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b>
				=
				<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">γραμματεύς</span>
			, <i>clerk, registrar</i>, <i><span class="en">
				Hdt.
				2.28
